#: ../../index.md:1
msgid "Lugha Reference API"
msgstr "API Ìtọ́kasí Lugha"

#: ../../index.md:3
msgid ""
"Lugha is a small text generation API that supports African languages. Use"
" it to generate text, count tokens before you send a request, and choose "
"the region that processes your data."
msgstr ""
"Lugha jẹ́ API kékeré fún ìṣẹ̀dá ọ̀rọ̀ tí ó ṣe àtìlẹ́yìn fún àwọn èdè Áfíríkà. "
"Lo ó láti ṣẹ̀dá ọ̀rọ̀, ka àwọn token kí o tó fi ìbéèrè ránṣẹ́, àti láti yan "
"agbègbè tí yóò ṣe àgbékalẹ̀ data rẹ."

#: ../../index.md:5
msgid "Independent documentation exercise"
msgstr "Àdánwò ìkọ̀wé ìwé àlàyé olómìnira"

#: ../../index.md:8
msgid ""
"Lugha is not a real product. It is a reference API written to show how I "
"document an AI inference service for developers. The model is a stub that"
" returns predictable text, so every example on these pages runs and "
"returns exactly what is shown."
msgstr ""
"Lugha kì í ṣe ọjà gidi. Ó jẹ́ API ìtọ́kasí tí a kọ láti fi hàn bí mo ṣe "
"ń kọ ìwé àlàyé fún iṣẹ́ ìfọ̀rọ̀wérọ̀ AI fún àwọn olùdàgbàsókè. Àpẹẹrẹ "
"model náà jẹ́ stub tí ó máa ń dá ọ̀rọ̀ tí a lè sọ tẹ́lẹ̀ padà, nítorí náà "
"àpẹẹrẹ kọ̀ọ̀kan lórí àwọn ojú-ìwé wọ̀nyí ń ṣiṣẹ́, ó sì máa ń dá ohun tí a "
"fihàn padà gẹ́gẹ́ bí ó ṣe rí."

#: ../../index.md:11
msgid "Start here"
msgstr "Bẹ̀rẹ̀ níbí"

#: ../../index.md:16
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "Ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ kíákíá"

#: ../../index.md:20
msgid "Make your first request in about five minutes."
msgstr "Ṣe ìbéèrè àkọ́kọ́ rẹ ní nǹkan bí ìṣẹ́jú márùn-ún."

#: ../../index.md:23
msgid "Handle errors"
msgstr "Bá àwọn àṣìṣe lò"

#: ../../index.md:27
msgid ""
"Every error has a type, a message and a request ID. Learn what to do with"
" each one."
msgstr ""
"Àṣìṣe kọ̀ọ̀kan ní irú rẹ̀, ìfiránṣẹ́ àti ID ìbéèrè. Kọ́ ohun tí o yẹ kí o "
"ṣe pẹ̀lú ọ̀kọ̀ọ̀kan wọn."

#: ../../index.md:30
msgid "Go to production"
msgstr "Lọ sí production"

#: ../../index.md:34
msgid "A checklist to work through before you ship."
msgstr "Àtòjọ àyẹ̀wò láti tẹ̀lé kí o tó tú iṣẹ́ náà jáde."

#: ../../index.md:37
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Ìtọ́kasí API"

#: ../../index.md:41
msgid "Every endpoint, parameter and response."
msgstr "Gbogbo endpoint, paramita àti ìdáhùn."